@startuml
title PayLink - Pay Bill Sequence Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Customer
actor Agent
participant "Initiating Customer / Agent" as Caller
participant "Payment API" as API
participant "AuthenticationService" as Auth
participant "PaymentService" as PS
participant "AccountService" as AS
participant "FraudRuleHandler\n(Chain of Responsibility)" as Fraud
participant "FeeCalculator" as Fee
participant "CommissionCalculator" as Commission
participant "WalletService" as Wallet
participant "BillerAdapterFactory" as Factory
participant "BillerAdapter" as Biller
participant "PaymentEventPublisher" as Events
participant "NotificationService" as Notify
participant "NotificationProvider" as NotifProvider
participant "RetryScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "ReconciliationService" as Reconcile
participant "AuditService" as Audit
database "PayLink Database" as DB

alt Customer flow
    Customer -> API : Login / begin bill-payment flow
else Agent-assisted flow
    Agent -> API : Begin bill-payment flow for customer
end
API -> Auth : Authenticate and authorize caller
Auth --> API : Authenticated principal / role
alt Customer inquires
    Customer -> API : Inquire bill (meter number / service input)
else Agent inquires for customer
    Agent -> API : Inquire bill for customer
end
API -> PS : inquireBill(serviceId, billerAccountRef)
PS -> Factory : getAdapter(billerCode)
Factory --> PS : BillerAdapter
PS -> Biller : inquireBill(meter number / service input)
Biller --> PS : amount due
PS -> Fee : quote(service, amountDue, date)
Fee --> PS : bill amount + service fee + total
PS --> API : BillQuote
alt Customer flow
    API --> Customer : Show bill amount, fee and total; request confirmation
else Agent-assisted flow
    API --> Agent : Show bill amount, fee and total for customer confirmation
end
alt Customer confirms
    Customer -> API : Confirm payment with idempotency key
else Agent confirms for customer
    Agent -> API : Confirm payment with idempotency key
end
API -> PS : payBill(request)
PS -> DB : Find payment by customer + idempotency key
DB --> PS : Existing payment? / none

alt Existing request with same key and same payload
    PS --> API : Return original payment
    API --> Caller : Existing payment status
else Same key with different payload
    PS --> API : Idempotency conflict
    API --> Caller : Reject conflicting request
else New payment
    PS -> DB : Load account, wallet, service, configuration
    DB --> PS : Account and service data
    PS -> AS : Check account status / verification
    AS --> PS : Account status
    PS -> DB : Create Payment (Initiated) + status history
    PS -> Fraud : Evaluate context
    Fraud -> Fraud : Account status rule
    Fraud -> Fraud : Single payment limit rule
    Fraud -> Fraud : Daily limit rule
    Fraud -> Fraud : Velocity rule\n(count initiation attempts, including later-rejected;\nuser-approved AQ-14, 2026-11-25; prevent evasion through rejected outcomes)
    Fraud --> PS : FraudDecision

    alt Fraud rejected
        PS -> DB : Transition Initiated -> Rejected + status history
        PS -> Events : Publish REJECTED event asynchronously
        PS --> API : Rejected payment
        API --> Caller : Payment rejected
        Events ->> Notify : Deliver rejection notification independently
    else Fraud approved
        PS -> DB : Store fee quote and total on payment
        PS -> Wallet : holdFunds(walletId, paymentId, totalAmount)\n[key = paymentId/HOLD; atomic, idempotent]
        alt Atomic reservation succeeds
        Wallet -> DB : Atomic ledger entries\nAVAILABLE -totalAmount / HELD +totalAmount
        DB --> Wallet : Hold recorded
        Wallet --> PS : Hold successful
        PS -> DB : Transition Initiated -> FundsHeld
        PS -> DB : Transition FundsHeld -> SentToBiller
        PS -> Factory : getAdapter(billerCode)
        Factory --> PS : BillerAdapter
        PS -> Biller : submitPayment(paymentReference, accountRef, billAmount)

        alt Biller confirms within 10 seconds
            Biller --> PS : CONFIRMED + billerReference
            PS -> DB : Save biller outcome
            PS -> Wallet : captureFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/CAPTURE; atomic, idempotent]
            Wallet -> DB : Atomic capture: debit held total, record bill principal\nand credit PayLink fee-income ledger
            DB --> Wallet : Capture recorded
            Wallet --> PS : Captured
            PS -> PS : State -> Completed
            PS -> DB : Save status history + payment event
            PS -> Audit : Record capture and fee-income movement
            Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
            PS -> Events : Publish COMPLETED event asynchronously
            opt Agent-assisted payment
                PS -> Commission : calculate(40% of service fee)
                Commission --> PS : commission amount
                PS -> Wallet : credit(agentWalletId, commissionAmount, COMMISSION)\n[key = paymentId/COMMISSION]
                Wallet -> DB : Append COMMISSION movement and ledger entry once
                Wallet -> Audit : Record commission movement
                Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
            end

            PS --> API : Completed payment
            API --> Caller : Payment completed
            Events ->> Notify : onPaymentEvent(COMPLETED), independently
            Notify -> DB : Create SMS and push notification records
            Notify -> NotifProvider : Deliver SMS and push
            opt SMS provider unavailable (HC-05)
                loop Three additional SMS retries
                    Notify -> NotifProvider : Retry SMS delivery
                    NotifProvider --> Notify : Delivery failed
                end
                Notify -> DB : Mark SMS Undelivered after retry limit
            end

        else Biller refuses within 10 seconds
            Biller --> PS : REFUSED + error code / reason
            PS -> DB : Save biller outcome
            PS -> PS : State -> Failed
            PS -> DB : Save status history + payment event
            PS -> Wallet : releaseFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/RELEASE; atomic, idempotent]
            Wallet -> DB : Append release movement and ledger entries\nwith Failed -> Refunded transition atomically
            DB --> Wallet : Release and transition recorded once
            Wallet --> PS : Released; state Refunded
            PS -> Audit : Record financial release
            Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
            PS -> Events : Publish FAILED event asynchronously
            PS --> API : Failed payment
            API --> Caller : Payment failed; funds released (Refunded)
            Events ->> Notify : onPaymentEvent(FAILED) independently
            Notify -> DB : Create notification with error reason

        else TopUpNet returns Accepted
            Biller --> PS : ACCEPTED (not a final outcome)
            PS -> DB : Record Accepted; remain SentToBiller
            PS --> API : Payment processing
            API --> Caller : Payment is being processed

            loop Callback delivery (same success may be delivered twice; HC-06)
                Biller -> PS : Callback(reference, outcome, fingerprint)
                PS -> DB : Insert callback fingerprint / detect duplicate
                alt Duplicate callback fingerprint
                    DB --> PS : Duplicate
                    PS -> Audit : Log duplicate callback fingerprint
                    Audit -> DB : Append callback audit record
                    PS --> Biller : Acknowledge duplicate
                else First callback for this outcome
                    DB --> PS : New callback
                    PS -> PS : Validate requested transition with PaymentState
                    alt Callback reports Success
                        PS -> Wallet : captureFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/CAPTURE]
                        Wallet -> DB : Capture held total, bill principal, and fee-income credit atomically
                        PS -> DB : SentToBiller -> Completed + history
                        PS -> Audit : Record capture and fee-income movement
                        Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                        PS -> Events : Publish COMPLETED event asynchronously
                        Events ->> Notify : Notify customer independently
                        opt Agent-assisted payment
                            PS -> Commission : calculate(40% of service fee)
                            Commission --> PS : commission amount
                            PS -> Wallet : credit(agentWalletId, commissionAmount, COMMISSION)\n[key = paymentId/COMMISSION]
                            Wallet -> DB : Credit 40% of fee to agent wallet once
                            Wallet -> Audit : Record commission movement
                            Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                        end
                    else Callback reports Failed
                        PS -> DB : SentToBiller -> Failed + history
                        PS -> Wallet : releaseFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/RELEASE]
                        Wallet -> DB : Release ledger movement and Failed -> Refunded atomically
                        DB --> Wallet : Released once; payment Refunded
                        PS -> Audit : Record financial release
                        Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                        PS -> Events : Publish FAILED event asynchronously
                        Events ->> Notify : Notify customer with failure reason
                    end
                end
            end

        else No response from a live biller within 10 seconds
            Biller --> PS : No response at 10 seconds\n(HC-02 response arrives at 12 seconds)
            PS -> DB : Save outcome; State -> Unknown
            PS -> DB : Save status history
            PS -> Scheduler : scheduleInquiries(paymentId)
            Scheduler -> DB : Store inquiries at +1, +5, +15 minutes\n(anchor: Unknown entry; user-approved AQ-15, 2026-11-25; deterministic schedule)
            PS --> API : Unknown payment status
            API --> Caller : Payment pending confirmation\nFunds remain held

            alt Original ElectroCo response arrives at 12 seconds (HC-02)
                Biller --> PS : Late definitive outcome
                alt Biller confirms success
                    PS -> Wallet : captureFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/CAPTURE]
                    Wallet -> DB : Capture held total and fee income once
                    PS -> DB : Unknown -> Completed + history
                    PS -> Audit : Record capture and fee-income movement
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish COMPLETED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer independently
                else Biller definitively refuses
                    PS -> DB : Unknown -> Failed + history
                    PS -> Wallet : releaseFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/RELEASE]
                    Wallet -> DB : Release movement and Failed -> Refunded atomically
                    PS -> Audit : Record financial release
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish FAILED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer with reason
                end
            else No late response before a scheduled inquiry
            loop Each scheduled inquiry (1, 5, 15 minutes)
                Scheduler -> PS : Execute status inquiry
                PS -> Factory : getAdapter(billerCode)
                Factory --> PS : BillerAdapter
                PS -> Biller : inquirePaymentStatus(paymentReference)

                alt Status confirmed completed
                    Biller --> PS : CONFIRMED
                    PS -> Wallet : captureFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/CAPTURE; atomic, idempotent]
                    Wallet -> DB : Capture held total, bill principal, and fee-income credit once
                    PS -> DB : State -> Completed + history
                    PS -> Audit : Record capture and fee-income movement
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish COMPLETED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer
                else Status definitively refused
                    Biller --> PS : REFUSED
                    PS -> DB : State Unknown -> Failed + history
                    PS -> Wallet : releaseFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/RELEASE; atomic, idempotent]
                    Wallet -> DB : Append release movement and ledger entries\nwith Failed -> Refunded transition atomically
                    DB --> Wallet : Release and transition recorded once
                    PS -> Audit : Record financial release
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish FAILED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer
                else Still pending / no answer
                    Biller --> PS : ACCEPTED_PENDING / TIMEOUT
                    PS -> DB : Record inquiry attempt
                    note over PS,Wallet
                        Keep payment Unknown and funds held.
                        Never resubmit the payment.
                    end note
                end
            end

            note over PS,DB
                If all inquiries have no definitive result,
                payment remains Unknown until reconciliation
                or a late authoritative biller callback.
            end note

            opt Late biller response/callback or authoritative settlement evidence
                alt Callback or settlement confirms success
                    Biller --> PS : Late CONFIRMED response or callback
                    Reconcile -> PS : Apply matching definitive success
                    PS -> Wallet : captureFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/CAPTURE; atomic, idempotent]
                    Wallet -> DB : Capture held total, bill principal, and fee-income credit once
                    PS -> DB : Unknown -> Completed + history
                    PS -> Audit : Record capture and fee-income movement
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish COMPLETED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer independently
                else Callback or settlement confirms failure
                    Biller --> PS : Late REFUSED callback
                    Reconcile -> PS : Apply matching definitive failure
                    PS -> DB : Unknown -> Failed + history
                    PS -> Wallet : releaseFunds(paymentId) [key = paymentId/RELEASE; atomic, idempotent]
                    Wallet -> DB : Append release movement and ledger entries\nwith Failed -> Refunded transition atomically
                    DB --> Wallet : Release and transition recorded once
                    PS -> Audit : Record financial release
                    Audit -> DB : Append financial audit record
                    PS -> Events : Publish FAILED asynchronously
                    Events ->> Notify : Notify customer independently
                end
            end
            end
        end
        else Insufficient available funds at atomic reservation
            Wallet --> PS : INSUFFICIENT_AVAILABLE
            PS -> DB : Initiated -> Rejected + status history
            PS -> Events : Publish REJECTED event asynchronously
            Events ->> Notify : Notify customer with insufficient-funds reason
            PS --> API : Rejected; no hold created
            API --> Caller : Payment rejected
        end
    end
end

note over PS,Wallet
    The hold uses the full totalAmount (bill amount + fee), as
    shown by Sara's 350.00 + 2.50 = 352.50 EGP example.
    Capture and release execute once with their payment outcome;
    notifications are independent and cannot change that outcome.
end note

note over Wallet,DB
    Competing holds recheck the same ledger-derived available balance
    atomically. When funds cover only one request, one hold succeeds;
    the other returns insufficient funds and is Rejected. The balance
    cannot become negative (HC-04).
end note

note over PS,DB
    The hold with Initiated -> FundsHeld, each capture with its
    success transition, and each release with Failed -> Refunded
    commit as one database unit of work. Publish payment events only
    after commit; movement keys make each financial operation idempotent.
end note

note over Biller,DB
    Callback fingerprints are unique in the database. Repeated
    callbacks are logged and acknowledged without repeating any
    state transition, capture, release, or commission.
end note

note over Notify,NotifProvider
    Delivery is independent from the payment outcome. Failed SMS or
    email gets three additional retries, then Undelivered. Push retry
    behavior remains open (AQ-16).
end note

note over PS,Commission
    On every successful completion path (immediate response, callback,
    inquiry, or reconciliation), credit 40% of the service fee to the
    agent wallet only for agent-assisted payments, once per payment.
end note

note over Auth,API
    Credential fields and agent credential lifecycle remain
    unspecified (AQ-01/AQ-04); this sequence adds no credential rule.
end note

note right of Caller
    Caller is the Customer or Agent that initiated the current flow;
    this lifeline is a shared response destination, not a third role.
    Payment notifications to the customer remain a separate flow.
end note

@enduml
